      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_04",
      "hash64": "05FBEDD5E6CC85C1",
      "text": "我在入口又碰到他，\\n所以邀請他和我對戰，卻被拒絕了！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_05",
      "hash64": "05FBECD5E6CC840E",
      "text": "「妮莫是冠軍又是天才，\\n就算對戰也只有輸而已，我才不想打。」\\r\\n……他竟然這麼對我說！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_06",
      "hash64": "05FBEBD5E6CC825B",
      "text": "寶可夢對戰就算輸了，\\n也很有趣不是嗎！？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "AA608DC26FF612D9",
      "text": "輸了也很有趣",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "AA608AC26FF60DC0",
      "text": "還是想要贏",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_07a",
      "hash64": "F790D2772D7ED58B",
      "text": "是吧！\\n就算輸了，還是有收穫的！\\r\\n……雖然會很不甘心沒錯！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_07b",
      "hash64": "F790D3772D7ED73E",
      "text": "啊，嗯，這樣啊……\\n當然比起輸，我也想贏，\\r\\n但就算輸了，還是會覺得很有趣的！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_08",
      "hash64": "05FBE9D5E6CC7EF5",
      "text": "嗯……\\n寶可夢對戰，真是太深奧了。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_09",
      "hash64": "05FBE8D5E6CC7D42",
      "text": "……話說回來，說什麼天才啊！\\n我這麼這麼努力，\\r\\n把這個字套在我身上我可不會開心～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
